Rule 3 (input tensors must have the same number of dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)

Rule 8 (tensor must have an integer dtype: 1–5)
{v1: tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 5

Rule 13 (tensor must have a floating-point dtype: 6–8)
