{v_1 : int ⊎ float, v_2 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≤ v_2

Rule 11 (index tensor (v_3) is within the input tensor along the specified dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : tensor} |= min(v_3) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_3) ≤ shape(v_1, v_2) − 1

Rule 23 (3-dimensional tensor with all positive shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

